      "summaries": {
        "en": "Gentleman.Dots is a personal configuration setup for LazyVim, a modern Neovim distribution, that helps developers streamline their coding workflow by providing pre-configured settings and plugins. It demonstrates how thoughtful configuration can transform a text editor into a powerful IDE-like environment through modular design and community-driven plugin integration. Developers can clone this repository to quickly bootstrap their own customized Vim environment, then modify the configuration files to add or remove plugins, adjust key mappings, and tailor the setup to their specific programming languages and workflows.",
        "zh": "Gentleman.Dots 是针对 LazyVim 的个人配置项目，旨在通过预置设置和插件优化编程工作流。该项目采用模块化设计，集成社区插件，将文本编辑器转变为类 IDE 环境，平衡开箱即用的便利性与高度可定制性。用户可克隆仓库快速搭建个性化 Vim 环境，并通过修改配置文件增删插件、调整快捷键，根据编程语言和习惯深度定制，适合希望提升编辑效率但不愿从零配置的 Vim 用户。",
        "es": "Gentleman.Dots is a personal configuration setup for LazyVim, a modern Neovim distribution, that helps developers streamline their coding workflow by providing pre-configured settings and plugins. It demonstrates how thoughtful configuration can transform a text editor into a powerful IDE-like environment through modular design and community-driven plugin integration. Developers can clone this repository to quickly bootstrap their own customized Vim environment, then modify the configuration files to add or remove plugins, adjust key mappings, and tailor the setup to their specific programming languages and workflows.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Gentleman.Dots gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Gentleman.Dots is a personal configuration setup for LazyVim, a modern Neovim distribution, that helps developers streamline their coding workflow by providing pre-configured settings and plugins. It demonstrates how thoughtful configuration can transform a text editor into a powerful IDE-like environment through modular design and community-driven plugin integration. Developers can clone this repository to quickly bootstrap their own customized Vim environment, then modify the configuration files to add or remove plugins, adjust key mappings, and tailor the setup to their specific programming languages and workflows.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Gentleman-Programming/Gentleman.Dots for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
